# {{ .Service.Name }}

Background **worker** scaffolded by `infragenie generate` from the Golden Path
**{{ .GoldenPath.Name }}**. Conformant by construction — `infragenie review`
reports zero Golden Path findings.

A worker pulls work from a queue/stream; it has no Service or ingress, only a
metrics port. The manifest ships non-root, read-only rootfs, a default-deny
NetworkPolicy (egress only), resource limits, and exec probes.

## Layout

| File | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `deployment.yaml` | Deployment + co-located NetworkPolicy (egress-only) |
| `Dockerfile` | Multi-stage, distroless, non-root |
| `.github/workflows/ci.yml` | CI workflow covering the Golden Path's required steps |

## What you still own

Application code and the `Dockerfile` build stage, real exec/healthcheck probes,
real CI step commands (placeholders), `TODO` label/annotation values, and the
egress rules to your queue/DB.
